---
import BackLink from '../components/BackLink.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, SOURCE_URL } from '../lib/config';
---

<Layout title="Privacy · Grade Viewer" description="Grade Viewer is no longer available. How this site handled logins, and what is being deleted.">
	<main class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl px-4 py-10 pb-16">
		<div class="-ml-1 flex items-center gap-1">
			<BackLink href="/" label="Back" />
			<h1 class="text-xl font-medium">Privacy</h1>
		</div>
		<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Last updated August 31, 2026</p>

		<div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
			<p>
				Grade Viewer is shut down. It does not accept sign-in and it does not connect to any school
				district system. It was an independent project. It was not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
				associated with Edupoint Educational Systems or any school district.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-base font-medium text-foreground">What we did not keep</h2>
			<p>
				This website did not receive your password, gradebook, documents, mail, or attendance. Those
				stayed between your browser and your school’s official system. We did not create accounts or
				keep a student database. What-if scores stayed on this device and were never sent anywhere.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-base font-medium text-foreground">What stayed on your device</h2>
			<p>
				After sign-in, this browser could keep an encrypted copy of your login so you did not have to
				type it again. Opening this site now deletes that saved login, along with any local grade,
				mail, document, or attendance copies in this browser.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-base font-medium text-foreground">Usage counts</h2>
			<p>
				To count unique sign-ins, the browser used to send a one-way hash of an email address—not
				the email, password, or grades. Nobody could turn that hash back into an email. Those hashed
				IDs are being deleted. This site no longer records them.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-base font-medium text-foreground">Hosting</h2>
			<p>
				The host still serves these pages and ordinary website logs (someone visited the site). It
				does not get a password or gradebook. The relay that used to help the browser reach a
				district system is no longer used for that.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-base font-medium text-foreground">Open source</h2>
			<p>
				You can still read the code at
				{' '}<a class="underline" href={SOURCE_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{SOURCE_URL.replace('https://', '')}</a>.
			</p>

			<h2 class="text-base font-medium text-foreground">Questions</h2>
			<p>
				Email
				{' '}<a class="underline" href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
			</p>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>
